# C2-S08 / C2-S09 — the arena trial and the arena memorial.
# Source: Production Master 2.1, lines 2307–2343.
# Scene: scenes/chapter2/arena_district.tscn. Losing never hard-fails.

~ enter
Vex: Ironhold! Look what the road's brought us! A brand-new face, all its own teeth, and a sword it holds like a soup ladle!
Elara: Hit whoever's trying to hit you. That's my whole strategy, and I'm still here.
Kaelen: I was hoping for a strategy with at least one if-statement in it.
Elara: My part is standing behind you with a bow. Nobody said I had to be clever about it.
[if ch2_seraphina_met] Seraphina: His left shoulder drops before he swings.
[if ch2_seraphina_met] Kaelen: Left shoulder, then the swing. That I can actually use.
[if ch2_seraphina_met] Elara: Oh, so her strategy you'll use.

# Between rounds, after the first win.
~ memorial
Kaelen: There are names carved on that wall, and some of them are flickering. Like a screen with a loose cable.
Seraphina: The arena started as defender training. People wanted danger with a bell.
Kaelen: Danger with a bell? What does that mean?
Seraphina: Outside the walls, danger comes whenever it likes. In here, we ring first.
Kaelen: That one just changed. A letter moved while I was reading it.
Seraphina: That's why I keep paper copies. Every name, in my own hand.
set ch2_arena_memorial_seen

~ victory
Vex: And the crowd goes— well, the crowd goes somewhere! Same time tomorrow, Ironhold, and bring the fighter!

~ defeat
Vex: Down he goes! Up he gets, I hope! Nobody leaves my arena dead, that's the one rule!

~ again
Vex: Another round? Ironhold wants one! Press {ui_accept} to fight again, or {ui_cancel} to go back to the city!

~ again_after_loss
Vex: Bad luck, fighter! Ironhold loves a comeback! Press {ui_accept} to try again, or {ui_cancel} to leave!
